<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener 1996 net profit rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Wegener 1996 net profit rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    10.42 vs   9.77</p>
<p>    Net profit			    69.4  vs  58.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.65 vs   3.42</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.50 vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   113.3  vs  82.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected publisher Wegener NV to report a net profit of 68 million to 69 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Interest		   charge    6.1  vs   2.5 gain</p>
<p>    Tax				     36.4  vs  28.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
